      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am a user of 2-factor. I see no problem to taking the headset off. The codes normally last I would guess about 45 second maybe 30. I would not want the two factor to last through logins mostly because in game, it logs me right in without it. I don’t have to use it every time I log into the game and I personally don’t mind using it every time on the website. My forethought is, if you want to get rid of the two factor, disable it and don’t use it. I see no problem with removing the headset when you have to do the occasional relog. I like having two factor for every login so I know my account has that extra security. I don’t want anything to happen that can add loopholes to what is meant to be the safest option for your account.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
