      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5afdbc19c7f1561107479436|full_name}: It's just the way to use it is not great, some people find it just akward and not easy. There should some better ways to complete 2FS first then put on the VR headset. That is more \"friendly\" use and you're quicker online. Even BEFORE you start streaming, which is very important part. Because if you start already streaming, and you must type login / 2FS step, you need switch to censor mode and type in.\nActually that goes also for when server kicked you out, or someone with hacked client kicked you out.\n\nThis can done outside VR, just looking on desktop screen. Not in VR screen (which is used for streaming).\n\nAnd some headsets are bit hard to look on VR display due smaller FOV.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
